{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "5316f8fc8671644b151fe5bcfc4120d730bbaaab8743425e5e3cbf4c4929d353", "ja": "じゃあふたりとも、\nさっそく、特訓メニューを組んでみない？", "zh": "那么两位，\n我们要不要马上来安排特训菜单？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "771dfc0a640d49ab88fb96e37650b363d8bf0d98a77318f21d7110a8170fae29", "ja": "おっ、いいね！　どうせなら、いつものレッスンじゃ\nできないようなことにチャレンジしたいよね。", "zh": "哦，好啊！既然都要特训了，\n我想挑战平常做不了的训练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "34affc4febef7214832ae2ccb9ade259e4c661c45dcc8945d69b82b37e8242a8", "ja": "そうだよな。なんたって特訓だもんな！\nやっぱトクベツじゃないとダメだって！", "zh": "就是说啊，这可是特训嘛！\n当然要很特别才行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5ce86d8cb68368f5d4cb4fcc0b92a5fcd70d15f3f895ce2d714232051d006330", "ja": "（次の公演のセンターは、紗代子で行くことにした。\n……と、決めたのはついさっきなんだが……）", "zh": "（下次公演的Center决定由纱代子担任。\n……这件事不过才刚定案……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "bd540e8d8d4c400cfe5e49e7e9baa82ae0690335157ed0ba34dfb8e38b05d5ca", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　のり子さんと\n昴ちゃんが、特訓につきあってくれるそうです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n法子和小昴说愿意陪我特训喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8068bc5ee862d9a713f2388bd1d2bd52898b2c8b8e7c3c0e6cbb4d87c64221e4", "ja": "……そ、そうみたいだな。まさか指名直後に、特訓の\nメンバーまで決まるとは思わなかったが……まあいい。", "zh": "……看、看来是呢。没想到才刚指名完，\n马上连特训成员都决定好了……也罢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e12cade577c45a95a0198eccc1f206e9cf0ef60bfff12987e81c167f42b2efec", "ja": "それじゃ、のり子と昴もよろしくな！\nそれで、どんな特訓をするつもりなんだ？", "zh": "那么也请法子和昴多多指教啰！\n所以你们打算要做什么特训啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "217392cd8ca4a6d5a6665514ab1b5b3a8f8713c3a17421b0547f63c35e501c82", "ja": "何をするかは、まだ決まってないですけど……\n最高のステージができるように、全力でがんばります！", "zh": "特训内容还没决定……\n但我们一定会尽最大的努力，完成最棒的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a74aa040539658e584b639e3dae6f152e7ce8228cbe859985effe9e8f68e9eb9", "ja": "うん、やる気充分で何よりだ。\nただ、やりすぎにも充分……", "zh": "嗯，这样干劲十足再好不过了。\n但千万要注意不能过度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "12176b5861e87bb5e80de4002801adf066f495d6c117e55efdcc6a6a4618700b", "ja": "わかってます、やりすぎは禁物ですよね！\n……でも私、やり残しも無いようにしたいんです。", "zh": "我知道，过犹不及对吧！\n……不过，我希望能让自己不留一丝遗憾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "1d52e0aae4e5d25ae3742bce1caffefae6cef13ba0b9ebb2a10a0de8be59d244", "ja": "あとから後悔するくらいなら、できる限りのことは\nしておきたい。だから、ムリしない範囲で……。", "zh": "与其事后再来后悔，不如事前先尽力而为。\n因此，以不逞强为原则……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "a62aa4d08c51072078753ab65abd73b369aada80c8d17dbd4749b96175675b50", "ja": "ギリギリまで頑張ります！　ムリじゃない範囲で！\nやっぱり、自分を追い込んでこその特訓ですから！", "zh": "我会努力到极限！以不逞强为原则！\n毕竟还是要给自己压力才算得上是特训嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1012_p", "source_sha256": "97e2bad2f6dc2aa0e5f5c2932c90093773fdf8982ba7c34acbf5897f5859fa35", "ja": "そうか。それはまた……\n頼もしいような、どうも不安なような……。", "zh": "这样啊，那还真是……\n让我感觉很可靠又有点不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "e37e5848251a73fcaa7eeb9bac8aaf9b28c1551674c2855a9e9f80a3cbafa5bd", "ja": "おお～、気合い入ってるね、紗代子。\nアタシもとことん付き合うよ！", "zh": "哦哦～你很有干劲嘛，纱代子。\n我也会奉陪到底喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "39378f9c858b9e6010cbc855a96ef07b0ae267f35f9ecd1beef8d00b57c43ce5", "ja": "やっぱり極限まで自分を追い込まなくちゃ、\nリングに上がる資格なんてないからね！", "zh": "再怎么说，不把自己逼到极限，\n就没有站上擂台的资格啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "622a7f77d116ccad51de3bb35bec8c2a5b9ee286a281cd7ab0958c7240da3187", "ja": "そうだよな！　スタメンとしてグラウンドに出るため\nには、すっげー練習するしかないもんな！", "zh": "对啊！想要成为棒球场上的先发球员，\n就只有拚命练习这条路嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "cc073e5ff9d409065c86918b4fc2dca103ad703706b964465b83a8f8f3a48376", "ja": "はいっ！\nのり子さん、昴ちゃん、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "没错！\n法子、小昴，请你们多多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1017_p", "source_sha256": "38bacb6de4a17046c2381fea5c43550db530f497e9b0e31c772d1db5e34f8cf0", "ja": "いや、リングとかグラウンドじゃなくて、\nアイドルのステージなんだけど……。", "zh": "我说……这不是擂台也不是棒球场，\n而是偶像的舞台啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "9575e00fd293b086e93c46e7eac42c676f30a69a863a1da1e8119b6bf84c915d", "ja": "一緒です！", "zh": "都一样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "cb41ef1f9fd81d7c0d49bc9b1b3c8d7ae2572a61b05dbe9a297bb7412eab5365", "ja": "一緒だよ！", "zh": "都一样唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "b01d31ad213cfd0e6c7b5eeae1633f0078ebafb7566c03f7b30b27c2c4caad48", "ja": "一緒だぜ！", "zh": "都一样啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "905b0eba78014298eeca62e15793b8a11450d14d01213a34f8f851d3118e5d2f", "ja": "おいおい、何騒いでるんだ？\n3人の声が、廊下まで響いてたぜ。", "zh": "喂喂，你们在吵什么啊？\n你们三个的声音都传到走廊了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "ec453d45ef8e3ecdb8b2e1fb704e9399cc3fb39eaa0ea00f0c17ca0444d17aef", "ja": "あ、ジュリアと百合子じゃん！\nせっかくだから、一緒に特訓しようぜ！", "zh": "啊，这不是茱莉亚和百合子吗！\n既然人都来了，你们也一起特训吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "32e69c36809683757d771e4f57dabea54dc6c9ed436721b7a37ab1b92dc1d79a", "ja": "特訓って、なんのお話ですか？", "zh": "你说的特训是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "9aa3281496d4e1d032d7c90e9fd14b16168e5fce859e65df7e3b22f3d08ef84b", "ja": "あのね、今度の公演のセンターに私が選ばれて、\nみんなで特訓しようってことになったの。", "zh": "是这样的，我被选为下次公演的Center，\n所以大家就决定要一起特训。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "050e70a607b4418434af198523ed4d033775641608e1cda82eae69e00ae33095", "ja": "おっ、マジか！　やったなサヨ！\nいよいよ目指してた場所に立てるってワケだ！", "zh": "哦，真的吗？太好了，纱代！\n你终于能站上你所向往的地方了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "57799a2332734709013916dd0432137f7487597f3dc681b60848c94adde555d8", "ja": "そういうことなら、あたしもその特訓、付き合うよ。\nウチらみんなで最高の公演にしようぜ！", "zh": "既然如此，那我也来陪你特训。\n我们大家一起打造一场最棒的公演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "be3c69086b6bd9ee7e8476b585d2deaa4c35492c10df777b0ab2d6396939ec0a", "ja": "そうですね。ここに通りがかったのも、きっと運命に\n導かれたからこそ。私でよければお付き合いします！", "zh": "就是说啊，我们会路过这里一定是命运的指引。\n你们不介意的话，我也想一起特训！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "516394b9c1f880a6e504b68963b2034db1d516a5b5373b4ea3abba61fda1882a", "ja": "特訓といえば、格闘モノの王道展開！\n紗代子さん、私も燃えてきました！", "zh": "特训可是格斗作品的经典桥段！\n纱代子，我也开始热血沸腾了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "0f11ea218e4c85b914b9688190d6c2f8c32526ee7c20a3ab0757ba239f7d4d09", "ja": "ふふっ、二人ともありがとう、すごく助かるよ！\nみんなで一緒にがんばろうね！", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你们两位，真的帮助很大！\n让我们大家一起努力加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_1030", "source_sha256": "58428e061990907bdf963e699bce52859e5a281ce590f2025096883b43396801", "ja": "……わかった！", "zh": "……我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_2000_p", "source_sha256": "9f6b118c1c85bb2bccb2a7e00acb3ede499ba4317da86ef8e3a7d93e9250da75", "ja": "わかった。ここで止めても、熱意に水を差すだけだな。\nこうなったら、出来るところまでやってみろ！", "zh": "我明白了，现在阻止也只是往你们的热情泼冷水。\n既然如此，你们就尽力放手去做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_2001_027say", "source_sha256": "f3d51ec5986fa66fda0fc90d76392b5fd8a6350887473499cc230b5c62bd2cbf", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}！\nよーし、みんなで公演まで走り抜けよう～！", "zh": "非常谢谢你，{$P$}！\n好～大家一起冲刺到公演吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_2004_050jul", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_2002_043nor", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_2003_047sub", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_021_2005_026yur", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
